# Ledger-coverage declarations (#9922 F-087).
#
# The coverage census (`ledger_compare.py --coverage`, `make harness-coverage`)
# requires every Makefile --gate recipe to have >= 1 PASS/FAIL row in the
# tracked ledger, or a line HERE with a reason. VOID-only counts as unreached.
# A declared gate that gains a measured row fails the census (shrink-only:
# remove the line). Same contract shape as HARNESSES.unreached.
#
# Every line below is the same fact, stated per gate so each one is removable
# independently: ZERO rows in test/results/ledger.d at #9922 filing time. The
# tail of each line names what a recorded run needs.
cc-rollback-arm-a no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded run of the #1922 rollback gate arm A on the loss cluster
cc-rollback-arm-b no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded run of the #1922 rollback gate arm B on the loss cluster
test-active-active no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded per-RG failover run (cluster + iperf3 server)
test-chained-crash no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded chained-crash run (cluster + iperf3 server)
test-double-failover no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded double-failover run (cluster + iperf3 server)
test-fbf-steering no rows in the tracked ledger; needs an operator-authorized live IPv4 fallback transition and correlated peer-capture run on the loss cluster
test-private-rg no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded private-RG election run on the loss cluster
test-restart-connectivity no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded daemon-restart run (cluster + iperf3 server)
test-rolling-upgrade no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded two-cut rolling-upgrade run with per-stream traffic and both running-version transitions on the loss cluster
test-stress-failover no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded stress-failover run (cluster + iperf3 server)
test-wire-properties no rows in the tracked ledger; needs a recorded run (read gate, hermetic wrap)
wire_appmatch_twins no rows in the tracked ledger; #11056 proved every code leg hermetically (test-wire-gate-hermetic-lib, the policymatch fixture tests) but a PASS/FAIL row still needs a recorded run of the #9531 appmatch-twins gate on the loss cluster (operator-held; plan-deferred-lab)
wire_policy_deny no rows in the tracked ledger; #11056 proved every code leg hermetically (test-wire-gate-hermetic-lib, the policymatch fixture tests) but a PASS/FAIL row still needs a recorded run of the #9531 wire-deny gate on the loss cluster (operator-held; plan-deferred-lab)
wire_hostinbound_deny no rows in the tracked ledger; #11056 proved every code leg hermetically (test-wire-gate-hermetic-lib, the policymatch fixture tests) but a PASS/FAIL row still needs a recorded run of the #10029 host-inbound deny gate on the loss cluster (operator-held; plan-deferred-lab)
wire_nat_frag_needed no measured ledger row; live wire NAT fragmentation-needed acceptance remains deferred to a recorded cluster run
cos-simul-load-smoke no measured ledger row; live all-11-class CoS acceptance remains deferred to the qualified loss userspace cluster
cos-gate1-small-four-alone no measured ledger row; live Gate 1 solo shape measurement remains deferred to the qualified loss userspace cluster
cos-be-contention-harness no measured ledger row; live exact-vs-best-effort contention remains deferred to the qualified loss userspace cluster
fairness-cos-class-sweep no measured ledger row; live per-class fairness sweep remains deferred to the qualified loss userspace cluster
fairness-cos-throughput-headroom no measured ledger row; paired strict/surplus fairness measurement remains deferred to the qualified loss userspace cluster
